OL,3,GNEWSAPaedophile hid child porn on three
OL,4,Amobile phones
OL,5,
OL,6,FA paedophile has been jailed for 20
OL,7,Fmonths after he hid child pornography
OL,8,Fon three mobile phones.
OL,10,FLuke Birch, of Eign Road, Hereford,
OL,11,Fappeared before Worcester Crown Court
OL,12,Fon Friday where he was convicted of
OL,13,Fthree counts of making an indecent
OL,14,Fphotograph of a child and breaching a
OL,15,FSexual Harm Prevention Order (SHPO).
OL,17,FThe 39-year-old was on an SHPO for
OL,18,Fprevious offences last year but a check
OL,19,Fby police showed he had been accessing
OL,20,Findecent images of children on his
OL,21,Fmobile phones.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
